{
  "bookId": "hero-213016",
  "id": "bond-27550",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "27550001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克莱儿",
          "text": "咔嚓——嗒嗒、嗒嗒~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27550002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克莱儿",
          "text": "这个节奏，嗯，没错！是「那个人」的脚步声！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27550003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "又被你发现了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27550004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克莱儿",
          "text": "毕竟你是我最特别的粉丝，我会把你的一切，都记在心里。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27550005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克莱儿",
          "text": "嘘——你听！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27550006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "……怎么了？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27550007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克莱儿",
          "text": "奇怪，你心跳的节奏，和平时有些不太一样……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27550008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克莱儿",
          "text": "心跳的速度加快了，是因为什么呢？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27550009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "因为我想给你一个惊喜——\n一辆移动舞台车，希望你能喜欢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27550010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "只要开着这辆车，你在M城巡演我就放心了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27550011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克莱儿",
          "text": "谢谢！呜~我喜欢你心跳的节拍，喜欢它们和我的旋律融合在一起的默契！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27550012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克莱儿",
          "text": "我想——M城巡演的第一站，就定在你的面前！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27550013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克莱儿",
          "text": "你想听什么歌？我都可以弹给你听~\n还是……想听我专门为你写的歌？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27550014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "专门为我……好的，我会准备好摄影机，期待你的演出！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
